7851 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (The annual calculation of account balances is designed by the exchange. There is a concern that investors might )
/K 122
/P 675 0 R
/Pg 571 0 R
/S /Span
>>
endobj
7852 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (migrate to different groups after the initial grouping at the beginning of the year. We acknowledge this possibility. )
/K 123
/P 675 0 R
/Pg 571 0 R
/S /Span
>>
endobj
7853 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (However, the fact that the)
