/K 125
/P 675 0 R
/Pg 571 0 R
/S /Span
>>
endobj
7855 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (grouping is redone each year eases the concern to some extent. The cutoff numbers to )
/K 126
/P 675 0 R
/Pg 571 0 R
/S /Span
>>
endobj
7856 0 obj
<<
/ActualText (separate retail investors into different groups are also chosen by the exchange to comply with exchange regulations. )
/K 127
/P 675 0 R
/Pg 571 0 R
/S /Span
>>
